# macOS folder settings — never part of the addon
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# ⚠️ EXCON IS NOT COMMITTED UNTIL ITS LICENCE IS SETTLED (Session 257).
# The font files are copied into Media/fonts/ so the redesign can be seen in
# game, but they are deliberately UNTRACKED. Fontshare's ITF Free Font Licence
# v2.0 (17 Aug 2026, Media/fonts/ITF-FFL.txt) permits embedding in an
# application and separately forbids making the font software available through
# a "repository, download service, application or platform" in a form that can
# be "extracted or used independently". A .ttf sitting loose in an addon zip on
# a public repo and on CurseForge is extractable by anyone, which is the case
# the restriction describes. The font FILE's own embedded terms are the older,
# credit-only text — the same one General Sans already ships under — so the two
# documents disagree and the newer EULA is the one the download was made under.
# Khand is unaffected: SIL OFL permits redistribution by design, which is why it
# was safe to bundle in the first place.
# Remove these three lines once ITF answers, or once a replacement face lands.
Media/fonts/Excon-*.ttf
Media/fonts/ITF-FFL.txt
